        <mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;i&gt;The supplier, the order and its line post nothing. The receipt credits goods received not invoiced (2020), which the invoice then debits. The $3.74 between the order price and the invoice price goes to purchase price variance (5060), an unfavorable difference here. Each document&#x27;s ledger rows are found by its type and its key, not by its number.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="622" width="860" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
